## R5b proof: the four swept quadrics GMANRayObjectManager used to stub
## out -- Cylinder, Cone, Paraboloid, Hyperboloid -- side by side under one
## light. Each is rotated broadside (quadrics.rib's own precedent: Cone,
## Cylinder, Hyperboloid and Paraboloid all extend along their own local z
## axis, so an unrotated one shows only a thin end-on silhouette ring).
## This fixture overrides two of AGENTS.md's RIB authoring rules --
## "Translate 0 0 5" and "one scene, one thing" -- on quadrics.rib's own
## precedent; Format and Translate here are this fixture's own, not
## quadrics.rib's 1400x260/16, sized so each primitive covers well clear
## of GOLDEN_MAX_FRACTION.
Display "r5b_quadrics.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 640 480 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [50]
Clipping 1 35
Translate 0 0 15
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.2] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [1 1 -5] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 1
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0.3] "Kd" [0.9]

AttributeBegin
	Translate -6.5 0 0
	Rotate 90 0 1 0
	Cylinder 1.3 -1.3 1.3 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
	Translate -2.2 0 0
	Rotate 90 0 1 0
	Cone 2.2 1.3 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
	Translate 2.2 0 0
	Rotate 90 0 1 0
	Paraboloid 1.3 0 2.2 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
	Translate 6.5 0 0
	Rotate 90 0 1 0
	Hyperboloid 0.6 0 -1.3  1.4 0 1.3  360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
